OL,3,GNEWSADriver in A40 crash was over legal
OL,4,Adrinking limit - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe driver in a fatal car crash in
OL,7,FPembrokeshire last year was over the
OL,8,Flegal drinking limit, an inquest has
OL,9,Fheard.
OL,11,FAled Coleman, 23 from Fishguard, was
OL,12,Fdriving home from a night out along the
OL,13,FA40 between Haverfordwest and Fishguard
OL,14,Fon 14 September 2025 with his friend
OL,15,FAled Bowen, 18, from Trecwn, in the
OL,16,Fpassenger seat.
OL,18,FThe pair, who were travelling in a
OL,19,Fsilver Volkswagen Polo, were killed in
OL,20,Fthe single-vehicle crash which occurred
OL,21,Fat 03:13 BST.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
