OL,3,GNEWSADriver in A40 crash was over legal
OL,4,Adrinking limit - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FMr Bowen's family said: "His kindness
OL,7,Fand spirit will live with us forever",
OL,8,Fwhile Mr Coleman's family described
OL,9,Ftheir son as "kind and sensitive"
OL,10,Fadding: "He had so much going for him
OL,11,Fand so much to live for."
